	(descr "Keystone Electronics 3568 PCB-mount ATM mini blade fuse holder. Base 16.00 x 6.73 mm, height 7.37 mm. Accepts ATM / ATO mini blade fuses. Four 1.60 mm NPTH mounting pins arranged 2x2 on 9.92 mm long-axis x 3.40 mm short-axis pattern. Left two pins (1 and 4 position) tie to one fuse clip = terminal A (pad '1'). Right two pins (2 and 3 position) tie to other fuse clip = terminal B (pad '2'). Fuse is non-polarized.")
